SUMMARY: Spring Live Music Series: Jordo Arnott Duo
DESCRIPTION:Jordo Arnott\, aka “Jukebox Jordo\,” is a seasoned Toronto mu
 sician known for his genre-spanning repertoire and request-driven perform
 ances. From original projects and wedding bands to a Red Hot Chili Pepper
 s tribute\, his experience translates into an energetic\, crowd-focused s
 et. Guests can expect everything from The Beatles to Johnny Cash to Drake
 \, with Jordo putting his own spin on every song through his distinct sty
 le and on-stage charisma.
