SUMMARY: Spring Live Music Series: Sarah Fazackerley
DESCRIPTION:Sarah Fazackerley is a Blues/Rock singer-songwriter based in 
 the Greater Toronto Area. Her original music pairs powerhouse vocals with
  ambient\, folk-leaning guitar work\, drawing comparisons to Grace Slick 
 and Amy Winehouse. Most recently\, she joined My Son the Hurricane as lea
 d vocalist\, bringing her commanding presence to the band’s high-energy s
 ound.
