SUMMARY: Spring Live Music Series: River North Duo
DESCRIPTION:River North is a versatile Canadian duo made up of award-winn
 ing singer songwriters Matt Zaddy & Heather Christine. They have performe
 d across Canada and have specialty shows for St. Paddy’s day\, Canada Day
  and the holiday season. River North have been featured on CBC Radio 2 on
  the east coast and are also co-writers of “We Are The North”\, Mississau
 ga's official anthem for #Canada150.
