SUMMARY: ICFF and Lavazza IncluCity Festival 2026
DESCRIPTION:The ICFF presents the 2026 edition of the Lavazza IncluCity F
 estival\, an energetic international film festival and cultural event cel
 ebrating movies\, art\, music\, food\, multiculturalism\, and diversity. 
 As Canada's leading outdoor entertainment destination\, the festival show
 cases a curated selection of films representing Canada's rich cultural mo
 saic\, paired with a vibrant Festival Village featuring music\, dance\, a
 nd experiential activations. Located in the heart of Toronto\, this uniqu
 e cinematic experience seamlessly connects audiences under the stars with
  multicultural visual storytelling\, international filmmaking talent\, an
 d a dynamic exploration of community identity.\n\nJune 25 – July 19\, 202
 6. Festival open from 6:30 PM to 11:30 PM with activations open daily at 
 6:30 PM\, ahead of evening outdoor screenings.\n\nIndividual tickets are 
 available starting at $22 per screening. Early Bird 4-Ticket or 6-Ticket 
 bundles offer a 30% discount.\n\n*Every individual and package ticket for
  The Distillery Historic District screenings includes a curated food and 
 beverage tasting experience featuring partner stations (such as Masi Pros
 ecco\, Birra Moretti\, or a Campari cocktail\, Lavazza coffee\, and bites
  from Ferrero\, Barilla\, and Eataly). Online-only streaming passes (ICFF
  at Home) are available for $35.\n\n
CATEGORIES:Film-Festival,Movies,Outdoors,Event
