SUMMARY: Summer Live Music Series: Clerel
DESCRIPTION:Clerel is a Montreal-based soul artist whose live performance
 s create calm\, intimate atmospheres grounded in warmth\, restraint\, and
  emotional clarity. Drawing from classic R&B and contemporary minimalism\
 , his voice-and-guitar sets weave original music with thoughtfully chosen
  interpretations that elevate a space without overwhelming it. His work h
 as been featured on major international stages and broadcasts\, yet his a
 pproach remains understated\, precise\, and deeply human.
