SUMMARY: Madly - Presented by the ICFF Festival at the Distillery Distric
 t
DESCRIPTION:When it comes to romance\, everyone has an opinion.\n\nJoin u
 s for an unforgettable evening inspired by FolleMente (Madly)\, the lates
 t romantic comedy from Italian filmmaker Paolo Genovese. Before the scree
 ning\, guests can enjoy treats and interactive activations.\n\nWhat reall
 y happens during a first date? As Piero and Lara navigate the excitement 
 and uncertainty of getting to know each other\, their inner thoughts come
  to life\, creating a hilarious and heartfelt battle between reason\, imp
 ulse\, insecurity\, and desire.\n\nCome experience a night of laughter\, 
 connection\, and cinematic magic.\n\n
CATEGORIES:movie,outdoor-theatres,things-to-do-in-toronto,italian
